00:00:02,159 --> 00:00:04,794
Now, besides adding context and

2
00:00:05,614 --> 00:00:07,333
participants to chat,

3
00:00:08,201 --> 00:00:11,066
GitHub Copilot Chat also offers you these

4
00:00:11,439 --> 00:00:13,727
slash commands, which you also see here on

5
00:00:13,727 --> 00:00:16,096
