21
00:00:53,533 --> 00:00:54,752
select some code

22
00:00:55,698 --> 00:00:58,152
and then use a slash command here to quickly

23
00:00:58,649 --> 00:00:59,290
invoke

24
00:00:59,931 --> 00:01:02,192
a command, a feature if you wanna call it

25
00:01:02,192 --> 00:01:04,533
