40
00:01:35,481 --> 00:01:37,327
looking for. But if I run it like this,

41
00:01:38,515 --> 00:01:40,024
you see it will open up this little window

42
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:42,849
here and it will explain that code for me

43
00:01:42,849 --> 00:01:43,026
here.

44
00:01:43,893 --> 00:01:45,322
Of course, it can be a bit annoying to

45
00:01:45,338 --> 00:01:48,019
