47
00:01:50,737 --> 00:01:51,734
here in my chat now.

48
00:01:52,539 --> 00:01:55,369
Now besides /explain, I could also run

49
00:01:56,110 --> 00:01:56,400
/fix

50
00:01:57,721 --> 00:01:59,815
if there is some problem with that code and

51
00:01:59,815 --> 00:02:01,410
I want Copilot to fix it.

52
00:02:02,553 --> 00:02:04,558
I also might want to add some text here then

53
00:02:04,827 --> 00:02:06,441
where I describe the problem,

54
00:02:09,158 --> 00:02:11,432
like I don't want to use the

55
00:02:12,142 --> 00:02:13,254
